# Scoped, auto-expiring exceptions for the CRITICAL/HIGH vulnerability gate in
# .github/workflows/build-and-publish.yml. Keep this file empty unless a finding
# truly cannot be fixed by re-baking (for example a vendor-shipped static binary
# that only the vendor can rebuild). Every entry must carry an exp: date, name the
# binary it covers in a comment, and be removed as soon as the vendor ships a fix.
#
# Format:  CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# The Nsight Compute/Systems Go binaries that used to live here are no longer
# installed; the image ships the CUDA compiler, dev libraries and command-line
# tools instead of the full cuda-toolkit metapackage.
